    "sub_name": "系統安全",
    "sub_ename": "SYSTEM SECURITY",
    "describe_ch": "1.作業系統之安全管理技術、安全配置基本流程、常見攻擊與形式。 \n 2.應用軟體與資料庫之安全議題介紹。 \n 3.網路協定之安全攻防。\n 4.密碼模組硬體之安全檢測。",
    "describe_eh": "1.security management techniques of operation systems, basic security configuration procedure, and common forms of attacks\n 2.security issues for application software and databases \n 3.network security; attack and protective mechanisms\n 4.security evaluation for password module hardware",
